    description: "Meson: subdir() in a build file with no project() emits no edge (the edge src is the project symbol).\n\nRepro: root meson.build with subdir('lib'); lib/meson.build with subdir('x') -> only the root edge is emitted.\n\nCLOSE WHEN the nested subdir edge starts at its own build file's node.\n\nFound by the PR 3 (stable-id v16) WI-tatop build, 2026-11-19; evidence ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr3/tatop/RESULTS.md (Residuals)."  # 0453
